[{"answer":"My classroom is a large room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/1.mp3"},{"answer":"It's full of brightly colored pictures.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/2.mp3"},{"answer":"My teacher hangs pictures up all over the walls.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/3.mp3"},{"answer":"There are blackboards at the front of the room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/4.mp3"},{"answer":"My teacher always has writing all over the blackboards.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes the chalk squeaks when she writes on the blackboard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/6.mp3"},{"answer":"We cover our ears when that happens.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Our classroom is full of desks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/8.mp3"},{"answer":"There are a lot of students in our class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Our desks are full of books, notebooks and pens.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I try to keep my desk neat,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/11.mp3"},{"answer":"but I have a lot of things in there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/12.mp3"},{"answer":"My ruler and pencils are always falling out of my desk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/13.mp3"},{"answer":"At the back of the room is a bookcase full of books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/14.mp3"},{"answer":"We can sign those books out and take them home to read.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I have read a lot of the books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I like mysteries and biographies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/17.mp3"},{"answer":"so I have taken many of those home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/18.mp3"},{"answer":"There are also tables at the back of the room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/19.mp3"},{"answer":"That's where we do our artwork.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/20.mp3"},{"answer":"We spread out big sheets of paper,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and use paints or crayons to make pictures.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes we cut things out of magazines with scissors","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and we glue pictures to the paper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I like art class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/25.mp3"},{"answer":"After school, my friends and I often erase the blackboards for the teacher.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we take the erasers outside and clap them together to get the chalk dust out of them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/27.mp3"},{"answer":"My friends and I walk home together","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and talk about what we did in school","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and what we're going to do after supper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/69-my-classroom-2019-03-29-12-45-11/30.mp3"}]
